control: A reload its caller cancelled keeps the active policy and raises no alarm
removes: a reload whose deadline passed is taken as one its caller cancelled, so reloads that keep timing out raise no alarm
packages: ./policyload
tests: TestAReloadItsCallerCancelledRaisesNoAlarm
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

